            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8080/inventory/bulk",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": [
                "localhost"
              ],
              "port": "8080",
              "path": [
                "inventory",
                "bulk"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Adds and/or updates Inventory items in bulk .\n\nYou can convert any data file into this JSON body by just setting value of \"inventoryList\" attribute to the data that is converted to JSON.\n\neg.\n\n{\n\n\"inventoryList\": \\[\\]\n\n}\n\nThe ID of items which already exists will be replaced by new ones, and new IDs will have their own records."
