              "protocol": "http",
              "host": [
                "localhost"
              ],
              "port": "8080",
              "path": [
                "orders",
                "bill",
                "2"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Generated a Bill for given TableID.\n\nNote that the Bill will be generated only once, since all the orders for the TableID will become \"finished\".\n\nThe short record of the Bill will be stored in the BillRecords Table."
